I'd recommend using the ggplot_pxg <https://search.r-project.org/CRAN/refmans/qtl2ggplot/html/ggplot_pxg.html> function in the qtl2ggplot <https://github.com/byandell/qtl2ggplot> package.
(Brian Yandell <https://pages.stat.wisc.edu/~yandell/>'s companion package that implements all of the plotting functions but with ggplot rather than base graphics.)

karl

